# shell: desktop
# IV-028/IV-031: an image row shows its own picture, made off the draw path.
# The queue is what proves it does not block: the window is up and answering
# on the first turn, and the picture is decoded and cached on later ones.
note the window opens without waiting for any decode
expect-title trk_script
note and the thumbnail is decoded and cached within a few idle turns
wait 30
expect-file /tmp/trk_home/.cache/tiku-tracker
quit
